// Signal: 'sorted array' + 'pair' + 'target sum'  -> TWO POINTERS
// Signal: 'contiguous subarray' + 'max/min/longest' -> SLIDING WINDOW
// Signal: 'range sum' or 'count subarrays = k'      -> PREFIX SUM + HASHMAP
// Signal: 'anagram' or 'character frequency'         -> CHARACTER MAP
